ndOffset":201,"text":"本说明由项目编写，计算引擎的接口能力参考所列仓库。伤害区间依赖攻防双方的种族、等级、实际培养配置、招式、道具、特性与场地条件。应调用伤害工具并引用返回的引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP、百分比和假设条件。只有属性倍率不能推导实际伤害。当前本地桥接只表达基础配置、单打或双打、天气和场地；未表达的强化、异常状态、墙、入场伤害、太晶等不能当作已经计算。区间计算不是胜率预测，也不能证明招式组合在某赛制合法。","contentHash":"sha256:4147350b9f74e866fdff162eb8da3276833061e4cc05e6f7531e1027e4f58c34"}},{"document":{"id":"damage-request-checklist-v1","title":"发起伤害计算前要补齐什么","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"伤害 计算 条件 攻击方 防守方 对手 清单 输入 问诊","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"请先把问题改写成一个明确的对局：谁使用哪个招式攻击谁，以及双方采用什么配置。本地伤害请求固定为第九世代与本地参考资料版本，攻击方和防守方都需要可识别的成员及培养配置；招式应使用引擎可识别的英文名称或slug。只给一支队伍、一个属性倍率或一句谁更强，不能确定实际伤害。\n\n建议逐项确认双方等级、性格、努力值、个体值、特性、道具，随后确认单打或双打以及天气和场地。若用户允许采用某些假设，应在结果旁明确列出，而不是把默认配置说成用户已经确认的事实。调用calculateBattleDamage成功后，再引用引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP和百分比；工具失败时不能拿印象中的百分比补齐。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/engine/LocalDamageEngine.java","sha256":"32f1dee574465dd652fcce0933a70fda8b465abff962133905422413bc3a1efe"},{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage"]}},"score":3185,"checksum":"sha256:bd79ff5a9c99bc64643b994b76d26c5d211729600ac90fa3b3132cf3628d94d4","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-399167a88ff633fb4719a3d3979c712579438903e4e2fdb4aec9a0b5398e460c","documentVersion":"sha256:604a2524e320f0d16e72cd129d9e2c64fcdbdc0b08e93a96f3440959b762f026","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":135,"endOffset":291,"text":"建议逐项确认双方等级、性格、努力值、个体值、特性、道具，随后确认单打或双打以及天气和场地。若用户允许采用某些假设，应在结果旁明确列出，而不是把默认配置说成用户已经确认的事实。调用calculateBattleDamage成功后，再引用引擎版本、最小最大伤害、目标HP和百分比；工具失败时不能拿印象中的百分比补齐。","contentHash":"sha256:9e7ee999b0be221990ba2a2ef92eb06b6826808c74f7b79f2dd133f0769b045c"}},{"document":{"id":"status-moves-and-output-v1","title":"变化招式、伤害区间与击倒判断","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"变化招式 辅助 招式 威力 区间 百分比 击倒 秒杀 胜率 Status","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","content":"本地伤害桥接遇到引擎分类为Status的变化招式时，会拒绝生成直接伤害区间。这不表示该招式没有战术价值，只表示当前请求不能用直接伤害数值回答。用户想比较控制、回复或其他非直接伤害效果时，需要相应机制资料及对局条件；不能把伤害接口的拒绝解释成该招式无用，也不能虚构一个伤害百分比。\n\n对能计算的攻击招式，结果包括最小和最大伤害、目标满HP与对应百分比。解读时应同时保留范围和假设，而不是只挑最大值宣称稳定击倒。区间不等于胜率，单次对局计算也不证明整队强度。遇到工具失败、未知名称或未支持条件时，应分别指出失败原因，并说明哪部分结论尚无数值依据。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["damage","resource"]}},"score":1058,"checksum":"sha256:0fe8e773449f2cfe4f1435b603b94eea0715b8ae60636621be517b07c87210d5","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-281229d960fab68b8dc1f93bd2dfbbd37b322c38e46174dcbd7f667836b05d2e","documentVersion":"sha256:d648a36f7db97d2bf4881cdb580781320b947b145b778d982f1f2469e97eacd9","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":141,"endOffset":271,"text":"对能计算的攻击招式，结果包括最小和最大伤害、目标满HP与对应百分比。解读时应同时保留范围和假设，而不是只挑最大值宣称稳定击倒。区间不等于胜率，单次对局计算也不证明整队强度。遇到工具失败、未知名称或未支持条件时，应分别指出失败原因，并说明哪部分结论尚无数值依据。","contentHash":"sha256:5f92e40199d254542a63d07330ecdb89e4b409ad7c3d0b82910bfbab761ba934"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@4ea5c848}
