2026-10-30 20:45:04.018 INFO  [vio-agent-run] c.v.v.advisor.MyLoggerAdvisor - traceId=bde0c882 - AI Request: Prompt{messages=[SystemMessage{textContent='You are VioManus, a Pokémon-domain AI assistant. Solve the user's request only with
